{"id":2376,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为丰富校园文化生活，锻炼学生创新思维与动手实践能力，营造温馨和谐的社区氛围，5月31日下午，中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院创意手工体验活动顺利开展。本次活动设置拼豆制作、捏捏乐DIY两大趣味项目，吸引了众多同学积极报名参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUmLMZnRGsMNMRoo7lsMm9bMlMkLNUubUmG4nzrkL4VRU490gihFp2hmCIa0MkyaMYyDMkyDnml8LNUPMRGiLlQ2nzQRMzC4MRn7UlV2LNWFoR-DLRCanlWFMRVkLR-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZMmlsgtA8pUUcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38657&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/407646F542D14051FFE6C56344DAAF2B/826060EB/41B02\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 451px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LozNMPUz7YnNLDMomlZnlUZL8lPMl-usMlWRLz98UmGinzG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkysnSy4nkyiLmlbnlVfL7WRM4n7MNn7LmW7LRrkM4vioz6FozLYMmCbUzMFLzGYMRC4gtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4oRCiMYbw62U8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38657&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动前期，工作人员提前整理布置场地，整齐摆放拼豆颗粒、熨烫工具、超轻黏土、塑形模具等各类物料，为同学们提供了整洁舒适的创作环境。活动现场气氛轻松热烈，同学们全身心投入创作，自由搭配色彩、构思图案，耐心拼制拼豆作品，细心揉捏、塑形制作解压捏捏乐，在指尖创作中尽情发挥想象力与创造力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LnzWMknlCsUmGbLo7LDUzCbnzMRLNMu2MNMRLN-4M4lPnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfn1yZMSyZozLaM77DM4lsMllPo7rRU8W7L4l8L4lYL8QFn7CbLlC8n7QFMlVfL4vJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZMmlsgtA8pUUcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38657&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5AF8589304A67575E18ECCBD3543523F/DF91F4DF/5AA37\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 444px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LnzWMknlCsUmGbLo7LDUzCbnzMRLNMu2MNMRLN-4M4lPnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfn1yZMSyZozLaM77DM4lsMllPo7rRU8W7L4l8L4lYL8QFn7CbLlC8n7QFMlVfL4vJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZMmlsgtA8pUUcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38657&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次活动将美育实践与休闲解压相结合，让同学们在沉浸式手作中舒缓学业压力、收获创作乐趣，切实提升了动手实践能力。同时丰富了中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院文化活动形式，进一步凝聚社区活力，营造了积极向上、温暖融洽的书院文化氛围。</p><p>一审一校：吉思颖</p><p>二审二校：王熠暄</p><p>三审三校：王慧慧</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUmLMZnRGsMNMRoo7lsMm9bMlMkLNUubUmG4nzrkL4VRU490gihFp2hmCIa0MkyaMYyDMkyDnml8LNUPMRGiLlQ2nzQRMzC4MRn7UlV2LNWFoR-DLRCanlWFMRVkLR-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LZMmlsgtA8pUUcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=38657&e=.jpg"}